<td>phentermine resin 30 MG Extended Release Oral Capsule</td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"amphetamines-class-medications-http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm-826910\"> </a><code>http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  826910</td><td>phentermine resin 30 MG Oral Capsule</td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"amphetamines-class-medications-http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm-826919\"> </a><code>http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  826919</td><td>phentermine hydrochloride 8 MG Oral Tablet</td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"amphetamines-class-medications-http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm-900038\"> </a><code>http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  900038</td><td>phentermine hydrochloride 30 MG Oral Capsule</td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"amphetamines-class-medications-http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm-968766\"> </a><code>http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  968766</td><td>phentermine hydrochloride 15 MG Oral Capsule</td></tr></table></div>"
